// Security or System Event Log Cleared
// Detects clearing of the Windows event log. There is almost no benign reason to wipe the Security log on a production host, and it is the classic final step before an operator disengages.
// techniques: T1070.001   severity: critical
// source: rules/defense-evasion/event-log-cleared.yml  (GENERATED, do not edit by hand)
SecurityEvent
| where ((EventID =~ "1102" or EventID =~ "104"))
